/-!
# A125100

Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) = Fibonacci(k+1)*binomial(n,k) + (k+1)*binomial(n,k+1) (0 <= k <= n).

The 64 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A125100

